.TH WAYHINTD 1 2026-09-26 "wayhint 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wayhintd \- the wayhint overlay daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wayhintd
.RB [ \-\-config\-dir
.IR DIR ]
.RB [ \-\-socket
.IR PATH ]
.RB [ \-v ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wayhintd
draws the wayhint overlay on a layer-shell surface and answers the requests
.BR wayhint (1)
sends over a Unix socket.
When asked to show, it looks at the focused window through wlr-foreign-toplevel-management
(or Wayfire IPC), and for a terminal at the command running in it, picks the matching hint
sheet and shows it.
It does not take keyboard focus while shown, except in search and edit mode.
.PP
It reads nothing while idle: the context is resolved only when the overlay is shown or
refreshed, and sheets are re-read when their files change.
A sheet with an error keeps its last good version on screen, with the error shown at the top.
.PP
Start it from the compositor's autostart (for labwc,
.IR ~/.config/labwc/autostart ;
for Wayfire,
.B [autostart]
in
.IR wayfire.ini ),
and bind keys to
.BR "wayhint toggle" ,
.B wayhint search\-mode
and
.BR "wayhint edit\-mode" .
No systemd unit is provided.
Only one daemon runs per socket; a second one exits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config\-dir " DIR"
Read
.I config.yaml
and
.I hints/
from
.I DIR
instead of
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/wayhint/ .
.TP
.BI \-\-socket " PATH"
Listen on
.I PATH
instead of the default socket.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Log at info level to standard error.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.SH SIGNALS
.B SIGTERM
and
.B SIGINT
stop the daemon and remove its socket.
A socket left behind by a killed daemon is detected and reclaimed on the next start.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WAYLAND_DISPLAY
The compositor to connect to.
.TP
.BR XDG_CONFIG_HOME ", " XDG_RUNTIME_DIR ", " XDG_STATE_HOME
Where the configuration, the socket and
.I state.yaml
live; see
.BR wayhint (1).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/wayhint/config.yaml
Global settings, including where the overlay is placed and how the context is resolved.
.TP
.I ~/.config/wayhint/style.css
Optional style sheet for the overlay.
.TP
.IR ~/.config/wayhint/hints/ LANG /*.yaml
Hint sheets.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/wayhint/state.yaml
The search filter of each sheet, kept between runs.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/wayhint.sock
The socket
.BR wayhint (1)
talks to.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wayhint (1)
.PP
.I /usr/share/doc/wayhint/
(README.md, CONFIG.md, HOTKEYS.md)
.PP
.UR https://github.com/yasuoeto/wayhint
.UE
